>     add_generator("high", traj2, from_to(0, 200, function() {10}), priority
> =1) %>%
>     add_generator("low", common_traj, from_to(0, 200, function() (5))) %>%
>     run(500)  %>%
>     wrap()
> })
>
> If 'low' enters traj2 but res2 wait time is too long, can 'low' quite traj2
> and enter traj1? I wasnt sure if rollback would work.
> Kind regards,

See https://groups.google.com/d/msg/simmer-devel/HxEeQo8Gbw8/dibiRJXoDAAJ

Instead of changing the priority, just put the arrival in the other trajectory.

Iñaki

